    {
      "source": "Actually loads the <code>DBRef</code> from the datasource.",
      "translation": "实际上从数据源加载<code>DBRef</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns an array containing the constants of this enum class, in\nthe order they are declared.",
      "translation": "返回一个数组，包含此枚举类中按声明顺序排列的常量。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Loads a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of <code>DBRef</code>s from the datasource in one batch. The resulting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of\n<code>Document</code> will reflect the ordering of the <code>DBRef</code> passed in.<br/>\nThe <code>DBRef</code> elements in the list must not reference different collections.",
      "translation": "从数据源以批处理方式加载给定的包含<code>DBRef</code>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>。生成的包含<code>Document</code>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>将反映传入的<code>DBRef</code>的顺序。<br/>\n列表中的<code>DBRef</code>元素不得引用不同的集合。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves the given <code>DBRef</code> into an object of the given <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a>'s type. The method\nmight return a proxy object for the <code>DBRef</code> or resolve it immediately. In both cases the\n<a href=\"DbRefResolverCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>DbRefResolverCallback</code></a> will be used to obtain the actual backing object.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <code>DBRef</code> 解析为指定类型（即给定 <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a>）的对象。该方法可能会返回一个代表 <code>DBRef</code> 的代理对象，也可能立即将其解析。在这两种情况下，都将使用 <a href=\"DbRefResolverCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>DbRefResolverCallback</code></a> 来获取实际的底层对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "No-Operation <a href=\"../mapping/DBRef.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>DBRef</code></a> resolver throwing\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a> when attempting to resolve database references.",
      "translation": "No-Operation <a href=\"../mapping/DBRef.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 包中的注解接口\"><code>DBRef</code></a> 解析器在尝试解析数据库引用时抛出\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"java.lang 包中的类或接口\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the association defined via the given property from a given source value. May return a\n<a href=\"LazyLoadingProxy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>proxy instance</code></a> in case of a lazy loading association. The resolved value is assignable to\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html#getType()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty.getType()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析通过给定属性定义的关联，从给定的源值中获取。如果是懒加载关联，可能会返回一个<a href=\"LazyLoadingProxy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>代理实例</code></a>。解析后的值可赋值给<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html#getType()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty.getType()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Loads a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of <code>DBRef</code>s from the datasource in one batch.",
      "translation": "从数据源以批处理方式加载给定的一组<code>DBRef</code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
