      "translation": "将给定的<code>DBRef</code>解析为指定<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a>类型的对象。",
